<title>ITALY: Hungary, Czechs to take part in NATO-led exercise.</title>
<headline>Hungary, Czechs to take part in NATO-led exercise.</headline>
<dateline>NAPLES, Italy 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary and the Czech Republic will join NATO countries Italy, Turkey, France and the United States for air exercises in Slovakia next week, the alliance's southern command said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said Hungary and the Czech Republic, which together with Poland were formally invited on Tuesday to join NATO, were among seven Partners for Peace nations taking part in the manoeuvres from July 13-18.</p>
<p>The others were Austria, Macedonia, Moldova, Romania and host nation Slovakia.</p>
